{'symbol': 'O', 'date': '2023-01-09 19:12:00', 'title': 'REALTY INCOME PRICES $1.1 BILLION OFFERING OF DUAL-TRANCHE SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES', 'text': 'SAN DIEGO , JAN. 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- REALTY INCOME CORPORATION (REALTY INCOME, NYSE: O), THE MONTHLY DIVIDEND COMPANY®, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE PRICING OF A PUBLIC OFFERING OF $500 MILLION OF 5.05% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE JANUARY 13, 2026 (THE "2026 NOTES"), WHICH ARE CALLABLE AT PAR ON JANUARY 13, 2024 (THE "2026 NOTES PAR CALL DATE"), AND $600 MILLION OF 4.85% SENIOR UNSECURED NOTES DUE MARCH 15, 2030 (THE "2030 NOTES"). THE PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE FOR THE 2026 NOTES WAS 99.618% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT FOR AN EFFECTIVE SEMI-ANNUAL YIELD TO MATURITY OF 5.189% AND THE PUBLIC OFFERING PRICE FOR THE 2030 NOTES WAS 98.813% OF THE PRINCIPAL AMOUNT FOR AN EFFECTIVE SEMI-ANNUAL YIELD TO MATURITY OF 5.047%.'}